HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; object-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'

<html><body>Full policy that still lets inline scripts run</body></html>
